title: Samantha3A
---
// Talk target at Samantha's spot in her flat (Interact layer).
<<if not visited("Route1Dinner")>>
    {$samantha_name}: Five minutes. Stop hovering and sit.
<<elseif not visited("Route1Dishes")>>
    {$samantha_name}: I'm not moving. You are. Sink.
<<elseif visited("Route1Thu2Door") and not visited("Route1Thu2Dinner")>>
    <<if $r1_thu2_wine != "" and not $r1_thu2_wine_open>>
        {$samantha_name}: The wine won't open itself.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Sit. I'm not serving you standing up.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===
